react-native-nitro-sound 0.2.20 (iOS): release owned audio sessions on stop
with .notifyOthersOnDeactivation, so music or a podcast paused by a recording
or a playback resumes; covers the normal stop, a recording start-up that failed
before a recorder existed, and playback stop. Muqun serializes recording and
playback and awaits start-up before stopping or disposing.
Remove when upstream ships hyochan/react-native-nitro-sound#857 (or equivalent).

